mortality and medicosurgical management of Clostridium septicum infection</article-title><source>Surgery</source><year>1995</year><volume>118</volume><fpage>592</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7570310</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0039-6060(05)80023-6</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Katlic</surname><given-names>MR</given-names></name><name><surname>Derkac</surname><given-names>WM</given-names></name><name><surname>Coleman</surname><given-names>WS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Clostridium septicum infection and malignancy</article-title><source>Ann Surg</source><year>1981</year><volume>193</volume><fpage>361</fpage><lpage>4</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7212798</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00000658-198103000-00020</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>